lass="font-site-heading text-site-fg flex-1 [overflow-wrap:break-word] text-[calc(1.625rem*var(--site-heading-scale))] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]">Today&#x27;s bread</h2></div><div role="status" aria-busy="true" class="border-site-border text-site-body grid justify-items-start gap-2 rounded-[calc(var(--site-radius)*1.4)] border border-dashed p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><p>Loading your products…</p></div></section></div><div data-site-section=""><section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-screen-xl px-5 py-[var(--site-section-padding)] sm:px-[var(--site-page-margin)]"><div class="max-w-[65ch]"><p data-site-title="" class="font-site-body text-site-accent-text mb-4 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.1em]">The starter</p><div class="prose prose-headings:font-site-heading prose-headings:text-site-fg prose-p:text-site-fg/80 prose-a:text-site-accent-text prose-strong:text-site-fg prose-li:text-site-fg/80 max-w-[var(--site-measure,none)] text-[length:var(--site-body-size,1rem)]"><h2>Everything here begins in a clip-top jar</h2><p>This is a placeholder for the story behind Sample Business's bread: where the starter or the recipe came from, and who has kept it going.</p><p>Then say what makes it taste of something: the flour, the time the dough is given, when it is mixed. Two short paragraphs are plenty. Replace these with your own.</p></div></div></section></div><div id="visit" data-site-section="" data-site-band="inverse"><section class="text-site-fg mx-auto w-full max-w-screen-xl px-5 py-[var(--site-section-padding)] sm:px-[var(--site-page-margin)]"><h2 data-site-title="" class="font-site-heading mb-3 text-[calc(1.625rem*var(--site-heading-scale))] font-semibold tracking-[-0.01em]">Come in the morning</h2><div role="status" aria-busy="true" class="border-site-border text-site-body grid max-w-md justify-items-start gap-2 rounded-[calc(var(--site-radius)*1.4)] border border-dashed p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed"><p>Loading our opening hours…</p></div><